{"id": "en_thin_ice_p1", "total": 68.25, "segments": [{"text": "If you fall through thin ice, do not thrash or try to swim immediately.", "start": 0.0, "end": 2.9}, {"text": "Cole walks across the frozen lake, completely unaware of the deadly trap beneath him.", "start": 3.68, "end": 7.38}, {"text": "The ice suddenly cracks open, and Cole plunges deep into the dark, freezing water.", "start": 8.1, "end": 12.02}, {"text": "He must remember the 1-10-1 rule before hypothermia ends his chances of surviving today.", "start": 12.64, "end": 16.8}, {"text": "That means 1 minute to breathe, 10 minutes of movement, and 1 hour total.", "start": 17.38, "end": 20.94}, {"text": "One. Cole fights the cold shock reflex and slowly regains steady control of breathing.", "start": 21.66, "end": 25.46}, {"text": "Two. He turns his body completely around toward the exact direction he came from.", "start": 25.92, "end": 29.84}, {"text": "That specific patch of hard ice already proved it can hold his entire weight.", "start": 30.0, "end": 33.74}, {"text": "Three. Cole places both arms flat and kicks his legs to get completely horizontal.", "start": 34.36, "end": 38.34}, {"text": "He pulls hard on the frozen shelf and slides his upper body out carefully.", "start": 38.94, "end": 41.88}, {"text": "He stays low and rolls across the surface instead of standing on weak ice.", "start": 42.42, "end": 45.38}, {"text": "Rolling spreads his entire weight evenly until he begins crawling toward the tree-lined shore.", "start": 46.18, "end": 49.7}, {"text": "He slowly navigates the slippery terrain, heading straight for the safety of the trees.", "start": 50.36, "end": 53.58}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan, executed exactly as the ice survival rules demanded today.", "start": 54.08, "end": 58.0}, {"text": "There was just one problem waiting for Cole as he reached the snowy shoreline.", "start": 58.46, "end": 61.32}, {"text": "His 10 minutes of movement are up, and his soaked clothes are freezing so